Outside of certain challenge games, you can quite reasonably arrange to
have completed the invocation within ten player-moves of Rodney's death.
Completing the invocation activates Rodney's harassment mode just as if
you'd killed him.

Move N: Kill Rodney.
Move N+1: Step onto Rodney's space, using an autopickup_exception to
autopickup the Book.
Move N+2: Controlled level-teleport to the vibrating square level.
Move N+3: Controlled teleport to the vibrating square.

Check inventory; if candelabrum, book, and bell all uncursed, proceed.
Otherwise, attend to their uncursing. This will take up to four moves.
(I am assuming that, as a competent player, you checked that the Bell
and Candelabrum were correctly configured before you even took on
Rodney.)

Move N+(4..8): Light CoI
Move N+(5..9): Ring BoO
Move N+(6..10): Read BotD.
